{
  "Combat.Scorpion.Blind.Wasted": "You're too preoccupied with getting the sand out of your eyes, missing your opportunity to do anything other than that."
  "Combat.Scorpion.Venom.Cleansed": "[pg-]You manage to cleanse the scorpion's venom from your system with your knowledge of medicine![pg]"
  "Combat.Scorpion.Venom.SpellFails": "You try to cast the spell, but everything around you reels and swims like you've been plunged repeatedly into icy water, driving you to the edge of vomiting, and a flaring pain in your gut shatters what little concentration you still had. Your magic sizzles in its inception as you double over."
}
